header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mino Lance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mino_Lance_9381cd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Warrior Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warrior_Helmet_7e280b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\"><img alt=\"Gold Ingot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Ingot_ad1a7f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mino Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mino_Shield_7ca925.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Trophy_60a414.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThis cave is a very good place for both low-level team hunts and mid-level solo hunts. In order to reach it, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AMintwallin\">Route:Mintwallin</a>. You'll also need to talk to the NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Jamesfrancis\">Jamesfrancis</a> the first time in order to enter the area with creatures. To reach the NPC a <b>premium account</b> is required. Furthermore, once you complete a mission for him, you can enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a> at the end of the second floor and then enter another one (to the east) to go back to the entrance of the dungeon, avoiding walking back past dead creatures. \n</p><p>Lower level (&lt; 100) players should be very careful here because the Minotaurs deal a lot of damage. <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> is recommended for Sorcerers and Druids, and the blocker shouldn't lure more than 5 or 6 minotaurs at the same time. When solo hunting, you can take advantage of the larger rooms with many minotaurs to kill up to 12 of them at the same time, always being careful with the distance damage dealt by <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Prophet\">Minotaur Cult Prophets</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Zealot\">Minotaur Cult Zealots</a>. \n</p><p>The loot may not seem very good, but all of them drop Mino Shields very often, as well as occasional Mino Lances and <a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmets</a>. Because of this, it's highly recommended that you bring empty <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> and containers. There is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mailbox\">Mailbox</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32423,32096,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32423, 32096, 15)</a> (<a href=\"#/quest/the-postman-missions-quest\">The Postman Missions Quest</a> required). \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Follower\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Cult Follower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Cult_Follower_4d1a0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Follower\">Minotaur Cult Follower</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">950</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">600</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-155× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Cowbell (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Plate Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cultish Robe (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bronze%20Amulet\">Bronze Amulet</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Horn\">Minotaur Horn</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Mino Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Leather\">Minotaur Leather</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ring%20of%20Healing\">Ring of Healing</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Mino Lance (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Red Piece of Cloth</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Trophy\">Minotaur Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Zealot\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Cult Zealot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Cult_Zealot_586dc5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Zealot\">Minotaur Cult Zealot</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,350</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">850</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>